# Pairs with FailClosed. The configurator lists a granted group's tools without
# consulting the authorizer, so the default deny-all authorizer hides nothing.
MODULE: GroupToolsUngatedAtAdvertisement
TARGET: FailClosed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: group tools are advertised without the authorizer gate
PERTURBS: OpenSession

--- FIND
ToolGroup(t) \in groups /\ ops \cap Required(t) # {} /\ Gate(TRUE, policy, t)}
--- REPLACE
ToolGroup(t) \in groups /\ ops \cap Required(t) # {}}
--- END
